values ('f8a9b0c1-2d3e-4f33-8c23-3a4b5c6d7e63', 'introduction-to-religious-studies', 'Introduction to Religious Studies', 'Introduction to Religious Studies introduces students to the academic study of religion as a complex human phenomenon expressed through texts, rituals, bodies, spaces, ethics, institutions, politics, and everyday life. Students learn how scholars define religion, compare traditions responsibly, interpret primary sources, analyze lived practice, and discuss religious diversity without reducing traditions to stereotypes or devotional claims.');

